clean
shot project-imported
tap Projects
expect Winter socks
expect Leg - row 0
# The second sleeve: the section starts again at row 0, and Undo puts the
# old count back.
tap-id project-1
wait-for Leg
tap +1 row
tap +1 row
wait-for Row 2
tap Start section again
wait-for Undo brings back row 2
expect Row 0
clean
shot project-restarted-section
tap Undo
wait-for Row 2
# The repeat length is a choice: one tap goes straight to it and the place
# in the repeat is kept.
tap Repeat length
expect Rows in the repeat
clean
shot repeat-length
tap 8 rows
wait-for row 2 of 8
# Held sideways, the count stands beside its controls.
